{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/11","id":4999278210,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVVaUws8AAAABKfrugg","html_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/11","diff_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/11.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/pull/11.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/issues/11","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/11/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/11/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/issues/11/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dicebattle/routelens/statuses/a5be89e842855d4572280a0062365c7045fcb96e","number":11,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: verified route gateway and bounded failover / 검증된 경로 중계·제한된 장애 전환","user":{"login":"dicebattle","id":445458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/445458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle","html_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Version-aware route gateway / 버전을 확인하는 경로 중계\n\nThe gateway independently accepts signed traffic, selects an exact graph/generation and routes through two approved persistent native nodes. One same-version retry handles a failed primary; changed authority rejects obsolete results before response. Public coverage comes from the actual partial route. Explicit base_only requests remain unsupported.\n\n중계 서버가 서명 교통정보를 독립 수용하고 정확한 지도·세대를 정해 승인된 지속 노드 두 개로 요청합니다. 같은 버전으로 한 번만 재시도하고 반환 전에 승인이 바뀌면 옛 결과를 거부합니다. 공개 적용률은 실제 부분 경로에서 계산하며 명시적 base_only 요청은 아직 미지원입니다.\n\nFinal-head hosted concurrency exposed repeated synchronous bundle checks blocking the HTTP loop. The correction uses one owned bounded worker, shares only identical in-flight preparation and retains every byte check. The eight-success criterion, ninth-request429 and12s/4s deadlines are unchanged. Both failed hosted originals are preserved; they were not rerun or relabeled to hide the failure.\n\n최종 원격 동시 요청에서 반복 동기 지도 검증이 HTTP 루프를 막는 문제가 드러났습니다. 소유·기한 제한 작업 스레드 하나에서 같은 진행 중 준비만 공유하고 모든 바이트 검사를 유지하도록 수정했습니다. 동시8개 성공·아홉째429·전체12초/노드4초를 그대로 유지하고 실패 두 건의 원문을 보존했습니다.\n\n## Verification / 검증\n\n- Clean8f9c9f7: fresh actual-Seoul whole302/302 and unit262/262 passed.\n- Main independently inspected9,799 listed hashes,38 native route/trace pairs,18 public-success bindings, standard signatures, durable state,73 compiler jobs and exact cleanup.\n- Eight held requests all returned200 in2.752–3.448s; ninth429. Shared deadline12.012s, native lease4.146s and abort release34.038ms met fixed bounds.\n- Actual60.45s recording,11 reviewed frames, EN/KO390px IAB, no overflow/console errors. Recording processes9, server and tab closed.\n- Media/source hashes and315 local Markdown links passed. Four live SQL observations and10,473 original files are preserved with exact map omissions.\n\n깨끗한 소스의 새 전체302개·단위262개를 통과했습니다. 메인이 원문 해시9,799개·엔진38쌍·공개18건·서명·영속 상태·작업73개·정리를 대조했습니다. 동시8개 성공과 기한·취소 한도를 유지했고 실제60.45초 영상·11화면·한영390픽셀·미디어 해시·문서 링크315개를 확인했습니다. 실제 SQL4건과 원문10,473개·정확한 지도 제외를 보존합니다.\n\n[Corrected report](https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/blob/feat/p10-route-gateway/research/pilot/2026-10-25-p10-worker/report.md) · [Preserved hosted failures](https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/blob/feat/p10-route-gateway/research/pilot/2026-10-25-p10/hosted-failures/README.md) · [Contract](https://github.com/dicebattle/routelens/blob/feat/p10-route-gateway/docs/29-p10-route-gateway.md)\n\nNew head a5be89e hosted checks and original inspection are pending before protected merge. P11–P14 remain unfinished. This is an actual-process synthetic pilot on real Seoul roads, not real-driving accuracy, public-peer honesty or production availability proof.\n\n새 커밋의 원격 검사·원문 확인 뒤 보호 병합합니다. P11~P14는 아직 미완료이며 실제 서울 도로에서 프로세스를 실행한 합성 파일럿입니다. 실주행 정확도·공개 노드 신뢰·운영 가용성의 근거로 보지 않습니다.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T21:23:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:40:31Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"24ab5cbe09658f6fad7448e163af3d6a93e0f381","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"dicebattle:feat/p10-route-gateway","ref":"feat/p10-route-gateway","repo":{"id":1431737538,"node_id":"R_kgDOVVaUwg","name":"routelens","full_name":"dicebattle/routelens","owner":{"login":"dicebattle","id":445458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTQ1OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/445458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle","html_url":"https://github.com/dicebattle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dicebattle/orgs","repos_url":"http